A\ @Nested\ test\ class\ must\ not\ be\ private;\ JUnit\ cannot\ instantiate\ it=6ea9c01b-d381-4ea5-9ee2-638fbc9791e6
A\ concrete\ nested\ test\ class\ must\ be\ a\ non-static\ inner\ class\ (annotated\ with\ @Nested);\ surefire's\ default\ excludes\ and\ JUnit\ Jupiter's\ discovery\ rules\ both\ silently\ skip\ a\ static\ nested\ test\ class,\ so\ it\ never\ runs.\ Abstract\ static\ bases\ for\ @Nested\ variants\ are\ unaffected\ by\ this\ rule.=ab032273-a742-463a-b51a-af063d6e1bb4
